{"id":"level-up-2026-10-03","name":"2026-10-03 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s751","en":"Wildflowers abound in these meadows during the late spring.","zh":"暮春时节，这些草地上野花繁盛。","note":"abound · 富于； 充满 · abound in","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s752","en":"Her small suitcase fitted neatly beneath the train seat.","zh":"她的小行李箱正好能放在火车座位下面。","note":"suitcase · 手提箱； 衣箱 · pack a suitcase","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s753","en":"Carefully invert the container to release the sand model.","zh":"小心地把容器倒过来，让沙模型脱出。","note":"invert · 倒转， 颠倒 · invert a container","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s754","en":"Turn the crank slowly to raise the small wooden gate.","zh":"慢慢转动曲柄，升起小木门。","note":"crank · 曲柄，曲轴；用曲柄转动某物 · turn a crank","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s755","en":"The hook attaches to glass with a small rubber sucker.","zh":"挂钩用一个小橡胶吸盘固定在玻璃上。","note":"sucker · 吸盘； 吸根， 根出条 · a rubber sucker","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s756","en":"The historian examined how conquest transformed the region's architecture.","zh":"历史学家研究了征服如何改变该地区的建筑。","note":"conquest · 征服； 战利品 · the conquest of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s757","en":"The design needs only a minor modification before production.","zh":"这项设计在投产前只需稍作修改。","note":"modification · 修改， 改正 · a minor modification","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s758","en":"Dense fog delayed the ferry until late in the morning.","zh":"浓雾使渡轮延误到接近中午。","note":"dense · 密集的； 浓厚的 · dense fog","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s759","en":"We received an assurance that the equipment would arrive today.","zh":"我们得到保证，设备会在今天到达。","note":"assurance · 信心； 保证； 保险 · an assurance that","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s760","en":"The repaired painting will return to the gallery in a fortnight.","zh":"修复的画作将在两周后回到画廊。","note":"fortnight · 两星期， 十四天 · in a fortnight","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s761","en":"Strong winds may disrupt ferry services over the weekend.","zh":"强风可能在周末扰乱渡轮服务。","note":"disrupt · 使中断； 扰乱 · disrupt a service","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s762","en":"I packed my goggles before leaving for the swimming lesson.","zh":"去上游泳课前，我把泳镜装进了包里。","note":"goggles · 护目镜； 风镜； 游泳镜 · swimming goggles","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s763","en":"The tutor used a hypothetical situation to explain the principle.","zh":"导师用一个假设情境解释了这一原理。","note":"hypothetical · 假设的， 假定的； 爱猜想的 · a hypothetical situation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s764","en":"Visitors can converse with volunteers in several different languages.","zh":"游客可以用几种不同的语言与志愿者交谈。","note":"converse · 谈话，会谈['kɒnvɜːs]；逆向的；相反的事物； 反面 · converse with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s765","en":"His eccentric habit of naming every houseplant amused his friends.","zh":"他给每盆室内植物起名的古怪习惯让朋友们觉得好笑。","note":"eccentric · 古怪的，反常的；古怪的人 · an eccentric habit","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s766","en":"We organised a farewell lunch for our departing colleague.","zh":"我们为即将离职的同事组织了告别午餐。","note":"farewell · 告别； 欢送会 · a farewell party","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s767","en":"The workshop teaches people to repair common household appliances.","zh":"工作坊教人修理常见家用电器。","note":"appliance · 用具， 器具 · a household appliance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s768","en":"The students measured the mass of each metal block.","zh":"学生们测量了每个金属块的质量。","note":"mass · 大量的；聚集；团，众多；【物】质量； · measure mass","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s769","en":"The restored theatre helped spark a cultural renaissance in the town.","zh":"修复后的剧院帮助激发了镇上的文化复兴。","note":"renaissance · [the R-] 文艺复兴， 文艺复兴时期； 复兴， 新生 · a cultural renaissance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s770","en":"The guide identified several poisonous plants growing beside the path.","zh":"向导辨认出了小路旁生长的几种有毒植物。","note":"poisonous · 有毒的， 有害的； 恶毒的， 邪恶的 · poisonous plants","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s771","en":"The course introduces inferential statistics through carefully explained practical examples.","zh":"这门课通过详细解释的实际例子介绍推断统计。","note":"inferential · 可推断的， 推理的 · inferential statistics","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s772","en":"Offering tea was a simple gesture of welcome.","zh":"奉上茶水是一种简单的欢迎表示。","note":"gesture · 做手势；姿势，姿态；手势 · a welcoming gesture","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s773","en":"She was willing to admit her mistake and correct it.","zh":"她愿意承认错误并作出改正。","note":"admit · 承认； 准许…进入； 准许…加入 · admit a mistake","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s774","en":"A small electric motor helps propel the boat upstream.","zh":"一台小型电动机帮助推动船逆流而上。","note":"propel · 推进， 推动； 驱使 · propel a boat","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s775","en":"Rampant ivy growth had covered most of the abandoned cottage.","zh":"疯长的常春藤覆盖了废弃小屋的大部分。","note":"rampant · 猖獗的， 肆虐的， 泛滥的； 蔓生的， 疯长的 · rampant growth","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s776","en":"The workshop sparked her interest in traditional bookbinding techniques.","zh":"工作坊激发了她对传统装订技术的兴趣。","note":"interest · 兴趣；利息；利益；使感兴趣 · take an interest in","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s777","en":"The students measured organic matter in samples from the garden soil.","zh":"学生们测量了花园土壤样本中的有机质。","note":"organic · 器官的； 有机的； 有机体的； 组织的 · organic matter","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s778","en":"She plans to apply for a job at the museum.","zh":"她计划申请博物馆的一份工作。","note":"apply · 申请； 应用， 使用； 涉及 · apply for a job","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s779","en":"The guide explains technical jargon in language beginners can understand.","zh":"指南用初学者能理解的语言解释专业术语。","note":"jargon · 行话， 行业术语； 黑话 · technical jargon","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s780","en":"The tiny camera recorded an incredible amount of detail.","zh":"这台小相机记录了多得惊人的细节。","note":"incredible · 不可信的； 难以置信的 · an incredible amount","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s781","en":"Her ethereal voice floated through the quiet concert hall.","zh":"她空灵的歌声飘荡在安静的音乐厅里。","note":"ethereal · 太空的； 轻巧的 · an ethereal voice","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s782","en":"The designer changed the layout to make the timetable clearer.","zh":"设计师调整了版面，让时间表更清楚。","note":"layout · 布局， 安排， 设计 · a page layout","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s783","en":"I disagree with the proposal to shorten library opening hours.","zh":"我不同意缩短图书馆开放时间的提议。","note":"disagree · 不同意； 不一致 · disagree with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s784","en":"The walking group postponed its trip after an avalanche warning.","zh":"收到雪崩预警后，徒步小组推迟了行程。","note":"avalanche · 雪崩 · an avalanche warning","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s785","en":"The teacher wrote the formula beside a worked example.","zh":"老师在一道例题旁写下了公式。","note":"formula · 公式； 配方； 准则 · a mathematical formula","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s786","en":"The concert will pay tribute to the orchestra's first conductor.","zh":"音乐会将向乐团的首任指挥致敬。","note":"tribute · 贡品； 颂词， 称赞； 礼物 · pay tribute to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s787","en":"Discarded fishing lines can endanger wildlife near the lake.","zh":"废弃鱼线可能危及湖边的野生动物。","note":"endanger · 危及， 危害 · endanger wildlife","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s788","en":"She trimmed each stem before arranging the flowers in a vase.","zh":"她先修剪每根花茎，再把花插进花瓶。","note":"stem · 茎；干；词干；止住， 抑止， 堵住， 阻止 · a flower stem","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s789","en":"The report offers a simplistic explanation for a complex problem.","zh":"这份报告对复杂问题给出了过度简化的解释。","note":"simplistic · 过分单纯化的， 过分简单化的 · a simplistic explanation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s790","en":"Music plays a subordinate role in this dialogue-driven film.","zh":"在这部以对白推动情节的电影中，音乐处于次要地位。","note":"subordinate · 下级的； 次要的；下属；使处于次要地位， 把…列在下级； 使服从 · a subordinate role","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s791","en":"The survey revealed a growing trend towards cycling to work.","zh":"调查揭示了骑车通勤越来越普遍的趋势。","note":"trend · 伸向； 倾向；倾向；趋势；流行，时尚 · a growing trend","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s792","en":"The technician submitted a requisition for replacement workshop tools.","zh":"技术员提交了更换车间工具的正式申请。","note":"requisition · 正式要求； 征用 · submit a requisition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s793","en":"Finishing the restoration on time was a remarkable achievement.","zh":"按时完成修复工作是一项了不起的成就。","note":"achievement · 成就， 成绩； 达到， 完成， 实现 · a remarkable achievement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s794","en":"The mechanic found a loose cable inside the engine compartment.","zh":"机修工在发动机舱内发现了一根松动的电缆。","note":"mechanic · 机修工； [-s] 力学， 机械学 · a skilled mechanic","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s795","en":"Our itinerary includes two museums and a walk along the river.","zh":"我们的行程包括两家博物馆和一次沿河散步。","note":"itinerary · 行程表； 旅行路线， 旅行计划 · a detailed itinerary","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s796","en":"The exhibition examines everyday life during the industrial revolution.","zh":"展览考察了工业革命期间的日常生活。","note":"revolution · 革命； 巨变， 大变革 · an industrial revolution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s797","en":"The study explores the relation between housing and travel choices.","zh":"研究探索住房与出行选择之间的关系。","note":"relation · 关系， 联系； 亲属， 亲戚 · the relation between","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s798","en":"A reliable bus service would help people working late shifts.","zh":"可靠的公交服务会帮助上晚班的人。","note":"reliable · 可靠的， 可信赖的 · a reliable service","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s799","en":"The discount provides an incentive to book tickets early.","zh":"折扣为提前订票提供了动力。","note":"incentive · 刺激； 激励 · a financial incentive","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:s800","en":"Students often relate the novel's themes to their own experiences.","zh":"学生们经常把小说主题与自身经历联系起来。","note":"relate · 有关联； 讲述， 叙述 · relate to","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:w751","en":"abound","zh":"富于； 充满","note":"英 /ə'baund/ · 美 /ə'baʊnd/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0751-uk-cc224e5daafd.mp3","text":"abound"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0751-us-ddeae8da5060.mp3","text":"abound"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:w752","en":"suitcase","zh":"手提箱； 衣箱","note":"英 /'sʊːtk3ɪs/ · 美 /'sutkes/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0752-uk-061f0209e41b.mp3","text":"suitcase"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0752-us-009d71e24e4e.mp3","text":"suitcase"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-03:w753","en":"invert","zh":"倒转， 颠倒","note":"英 /ɪn'vɜːt/ · 美 /'ɪnvɝt/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0753-uk-2b3cd7be34ed.mp3","text":"invert"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0753-us-f5be187732b5.mp3","text":"invert"}]},{"id":"catalog:l